const failureCategoryLabels:Record<AnalyticsFailureCategory,string>={quota:"Account capacity or billing",safety:"Safety or moderation",rateLimit:"Provider rate limit",provider:"Provider execution",application:"Application workflow",unknown:"Unclassified"};
function failureCategory(payload:Record<string,unknown>):AnalyticsFailureCategory{
  const message=[payload.error_category,payload.error_code,payload.error_class,payload.error_message,payload.reason].map(text).join(" ").toLowerCase();
  if(/credit|quota|budget|billing|hard.cap/.test(message))return"quota";
  if(/safety|moderation|policy|content.filter/.test(message))return"safety";
  if(/rate.?limit|too many requests|429/.test(message))return"rateLimit";
  if(/provider|upstream|connection|timeout|unavailable/.test(message))return"provider";
  if(/compile|validation|invalid|application|workflow/.test(message))return"application";
  return"unknown";
}
